<title>INDIA: India Oct 96-Jan 97 sugar output 5.63 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India Oct 96-Jan 97 sugar output 5.63 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 5.63 million tonnes of sugar between October 1996 and January 1997 compared with 6.48 million tonnes in the same period a year earlier, the Indian Sugar Mills Association (ISMA) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Sugar production during October and January was 5.63 million tonnes,&quot; Shantilal Jain, director general of ISMA, told Reuters. &quot;We produced 6.48 million tonnes in the same period last season.&quot;</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
